{"hw":"συμμαχέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">συμμαχέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">συμμαχ-έω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">συνεμάχησα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.10<em>A</em>7</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(v B.C.)</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">συμμεμάχηκα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">588.61</span> </span> (Milet., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii B.C.</span>):—<b class=\"lex-tr\">to be an ally, to be in alliance</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pers.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">793</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.35</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.50</span> </span>, etc.: c. acc. cogn., <span class=\"gk\">ς. τὴν μάχην</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> l.c.: c. dat., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">366.8</span> </span> (Delph., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B.C.</span>), etc.; <span class=\"gk\">οὐ ξ., ἀλλὰ ξυναδικεῖν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">join</b> not <b class=\"lex-tr\">in war</b> but in doing wrong, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.39</span> </span>: generally, <b class=\"lex-tr\">help, succour</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ς. τινί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">740</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1368</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">440c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phlb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14b</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">τοῖσιν εὖ φρονοῦσι συμμαχεῖ τύχη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Critias</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ς. ὥστε.. </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">assist</b> towards.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.98</span> </span>:— <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span> <span class=\"gk\">συμμεμαχημένος</span> in act. sense, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">συμμαχοῦμαι ὑπό τινος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cal.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22</span> </span>. Cf.<span class=\"gk\">συμμάχομαι</span>.</div></div>"}